Subject: [PATCHv9 15/18] TEMP: OMAP3: pm: remove serial resume / idle calls from idle path
Date: Fri, 23 Sep 2011 15:46:23 +0300
Message-ID: <1316781986-30642-16-git-send-email-t-kristo@ti.com>
